<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-seventies-arena" category="Crunch" order="100" instrument="guitar" style="Classic Rock">
  <description>The late-70s master-volume British 100-watt head: preamp at medium, master up, into a 4x12. Big, open, ringing chords with a muscular mid punch and just enough grind; sustained notes bloom. Strum open chords and let them ring, or chug power chords on the bridge pickup.</description>
  <tags><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Classic Rock</tag><tag>Hard Rock</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>No pedals</tag><tag>Power Chords</tag></tags>
